WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.950
This is the story of Hapu.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.950
He lives in ancient Egypt at the time of Queen Cleopatra.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.950
His father, back, has a small factory.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.950
He makes gold tables and chairs.

00:19.000 --> 00:21.950
Hapu helps him.

00:22.000 --> 00:24.950
He is a fireboy.

00:25.000 --> 00:29.950
Every day, he pushes a long handle up and down.

00:30.000 --> 00:33.950
The work is hot, and it's very hard.

00:34.000 --> 00:37.950
But what can he and his father do?

00:38.000 --> 00:40.950
They are poor people.

00:41.000 --> 00:43.950
They need to make money.

00:44.000 --> 00:48.950
Every evening, they sit beside the Nile.

00:49.000 --> 00:56.950
Back talks to his son about the factory. Tomorrow's work, everything.

00:57.000 --> 01:01.950
One day, we're going to be very rich, he tells Hapu.

01:02.000 --> 01:03.950
Are we?

01:04.000 --> 01:08.950
The fireboy looks into his father's tired eyes.

01:09.000 --> 01:10.950
Yes.

01:11.000 --> 01:12.950
Back smiles.

01:13.000 --> 01:16.950
I don't know how, and I don't know when.

01:17.000 --> 01:18.950
But we are.

01:19.000 --> 01:21.950
Then he stands up.

01:22.000 --> 01:23.950
Come on, he says.

01:24.000 --> 01:25.950
It's late.

01:26.000 --> 01:29.950
Let's go home.

01:30.000 --> 01:36.950
Three days later, Hapu and back are making a table.

01:37.000 --> 01:39.950
It's very hot in the room.

01:40.000 --> 01:43.950
Suddenly, back stops work.

01:44.000 --> 01:49.950
What is it, father? Hapu asks, is something wrong?

01:50.000 --> 01:53.950
I don't know. Back answers.

01:54.000 --> 01:56.950
He closes his eyes.

01:57.000 --> 01:58.950
It's my head.

01:59.000 --> 02:01.950
I can't.

02:02.000 --> 02:06.950
And then, he falls on the ground.

02:07.000 --> 02:08.950
Father?

02:09.000 --> 02:13.950
Hapu runs to back and puts one hand under his head.

02:14.000 --> 02:18.950
Father, are you all right?

02:19.000 --> 02:22.950
The next day, back stays in bed.

02:23.000 --> 02:28.950
I'm sorry, Hapu. He says, I want to work, but I can't.

02:29.000 --> 02:31.950
I'm ill.

02:32.000 --> 02:34.950
Hapu is very sad.

02:35.000 --> 02:38.950
Father works too hard, he thinks.

02:39.000 --> 02:40.950
That's why he's ill.

02:41.000 --> 02:43.950
We need more money.

02:44.000 --> 02:46.950
But what can I do?

02:47.000 --> 02:50.950
Then, he has an idea.

02:51.000 --> 02:53.950
Of course, he thinks.

02:54.000 --> 02:58.950
I must make something for somebody very rich.

02:59.000 --> 03:02.950
Somebody like the queen.

03:03.000 --> 03:06.950
Back is ill for two weeks.

03:07.000 --> 03:12.950
In that time, Hapu makes a lot of tables and chairs.

03:13.000 --> 03:16.950
But not only tables and chairs.

03:17.000 --> 03:20.950
He makes a gold necklace too.

03:21.000 --> 03:24.950
There, he thinks late one night.

03:25.000 --> 03:26.950
It's ready.

03:27.000 --> 03:29.950
He smiles.

03:30.000 --> 03:32.950
The necklace is very beautiful.

03:33.000 --> 03:37.950
Queen Cleopatra is going to like this, Hapu thinks.

03:38.000 --> 03:41.950
She's going to pay a lot of money for it too.

03:42.000 --> 03:44.950
I know she is.

03:45.000 --> 03:49.950
The next morning, he goes to Cleopatra's palace.

03:50.000 --> 03:53.950
The necklace is in a bag under his shirt.

03:54.000 --> 03:58.950
What do you want asks a palace guard?

03:59.000 --> 04:01.950
There are two guards.

04:02.000 --> 04:05.950
Each one has a sword.

04:06.000 --> 04:10.950
I want to see the queen, Hapu answers.

04:11.000 --> 04:12.950
Both guards laugh.

04:13.000 --> 04:16.950
Go home boy. Says one of them.

04:17.000 --> 04:20.950
Queen Cleopatra doesn't see people like you.

04:21.000 --> 04:24.950
Hapu is very unhappy.

04:25.000 --> 04:28.950
What do I do now? He thinks.

04:29.000 --> 04:33.950
He leaves the palace and begins to walk home.

04:34.000 --> 04:38.950
But ten minutes later, he passes two men in the market.

04:39.000 --> 04:44.950
Cleopatra's women are coming here tomorrow morning, says one.

04:45.000 --> 04:47.950
They're arriving very early.

04:48.000 --> 04:52.950
They want to buy lots of new clothes for her.

04:53.000 --> 04:57.950
That's very good news, Hapu thinks.

04:58.000 --> 05:02.950
The next day, the fire boy gets up very early.

05:03.000 --> 05:06.950
He makes a cup of sweet tea for back.

05:07.000 --> 05:09.950
Then he goes to the market.

05:10.000 --> 05:15.950
I can give the necklace to Cleopatra's women, he thinks.

05:16.000 --> 05:19.950
They can give it to the queen for me.

05:20.000 --> 05:23.950
He waits and waits.

05:24.000 --> 05:27.950
For a long time, nothing happens.

05:28.000 --> 05:32.950
Then, music starts to play.

05:33.000 --> 05:38.950
A moment later, Hapu sees a long line of people.

05:39.000 --> 05:43.000
They are coming from the palace.

05:48.000 --> 05:52.950
Four men are carrying a very beautiful chair.

05:53.000 --> 05:56.950
A woman is sitting in it.

05:57.000 --> 06:00.950
Hapu puts one hand across his eyes.

06:01.000 --> 06:04.950
It's the queen, he thinks.

06:05.000 --> 06:08.950
She's coming too.

06:09.000 --> 06:13.950
A minute later, Cleopatra arrives.

06:14.000 --> 06:18.950
Suddenly, everyone is very quiet.

06:19.000 --> 06:24.950
Then, Hapu thinks, this is the moment.

06:25.000 --> 06:29.950
He runs in front of Cleopatra's chair.

06:30.000 --> 06:34.950
Stop, he says. Please stop.

06:35.000 --> 06:37.950
The queen looks at him.

06:38.000 --> 06:41.950
What do you want? She asks.

06:42.000 --> 06:46.950
Hapu gives her the necklace.

06:47.000 --> 06:52.950
Is this really your work? Asked Cleopatra?

06:53.000 --> 06:57.950
Yes, yes it is. Hapu answers.

06:58.000 --> 07:00.950
Gods, says Cleopatra.

07:01.000 --> 07:04.950
Give this boy some money.

07:05.000 --> 07:08.950
She holds the necklace in her hands.

07:09.000 --> 07:12.950
This is beautiful, she says.

07:13.000 --> 07:15.950
Then, she leads.

07:16.000 --> 07:18.950
Hapu runs home.

07:19.000 --> 07:22.950
He is very, very happy.

07:23.000 --> 07:25.950
That isn't bad.

07:26.000 --> 07:29.950
Look, Hapu says.

07:30.000 --> 07:35.950
He shows the money from Cleopatra's necklace to his father.

07:36.000 --> 07:38.950
But howl?

07:39.000 --> 07:43.950
Buck closes his eyes, then opens them again.

07:44.000 --> 07:48.950
I don't understand, he says.

07:49.000 --> 07:51.950
Hapu smiles.

07:52.000 --> 07:57.950
He sits down and tells his father everything.

07:58.000 --> 08:04.950
At the end of the story, Buck says, you're a good son, Hapu.

08:05.000 --> 08:07.950
Thank you.

08:08.000 --> 08:12.950
That night, Hapu looks up at the stars.

08:13.000 --> 08:18.950
Now, I can pay for a doctor to visit father, he thinks.

08:19.000 --> 08:22.950
Then, after father is strong again,

08:23.000 --> 08:26.950
but at that moment, he stops.

08:27.000 --> 08:32.950
One of Cleopatra's gods is standing in front of him.

08:33.000 --> 08:35.950
He has a big sword.

08:36.000 --> 08:41.950
Are you Hapu, son of Buck? He asks.

08:42.000 --> 08:44.950
Hapu looks at him.

08:45.000 --> 08:49.950
Yes. Yes, I am. He answers.

08:50.000 --> 08:53.950
Come with me, says the god.

08:54.000 --> 08:57.950
Queen Cleopatra likes your work.

08:58.000 --> 09:02.950
She wants to give you a job at the palace.

09:03.000 --> 09:06.950
But I have a job, Hapu says.

09:07.000 --> 09:09.950
I work with my father.

09:10.000 --> 09:11.950
I can't leave him.

09:12.000 --> 09:14.950
You don't understand.

09:15.000 --> 09:20.950
No. You don't understand, the god says.

09:21.000 --> 09:26.950
When the queen gives you a job, you take it.

09:27.000 --> 09:29.950
He puts one hand on his sword.

09:30.000 --> 09:35.950
Now, go and say goodbye to your father.

09:36.000 --> 09:40.950
At the palace, Cleopatra talks to Hapu.

09:41.000 --> 09:43.950
She is wearing his necklace.

09:44.000 --> 09:51.950
I want you to live here and make lots of beautiful things for me, she says.

09:52.000 --> 09:56.950
Thank you, queen of the Nile, Hapu says.

09:57.000 --> 09:58.950
But...

09:59.000 --> 10:02.950
But the queen looks at Hapu.

10:03.000 --> 10:06.950
But I can't live here.

10:07.000 --> 10:11.950
You see, my father is very ill and...

10:12.000 --> 10:15.950
Hapu tells the queen everything.

10:16.000 --> 10:22.950
At the end of Hapu's story, Cleopatra looks at him.

10:23.000 --> 10:25.950
All right, she says.

10:26.000 --> 10:28.950
You can go home to your father.

10:29.000 --> 10:33.950
But... But asks Hapu.

10:34.000 --> 10:39.950
But from today, the two of you work only for me.

10:40.000 --> 10:42.950
Do you understand?

10:43.000 --> 10:46.950
Oh, yes, Hapu smiles.

10:47.000 --> 10:49.950
He is very happy.

10:50.000 --> 10:58.950
Now, he and his father can make lots of beautiful things and be rich.

10:59.000 --> 11:03.000
Yes, I understand.
